window.bookSummaryJSON = "<p><i>Addiction is a bonus short story in the Explicitly Yours Series. It should be enjoyed at the end of the series or any time after book 2, Domination. Find out from Beau's POV what really happened that night ten years ago...</i></p> <p>It's ten years earlier and the night that changed everything. When Beau Olivier signs a contract that will deliver the first millions of his future fortune, all he wants is to celebrate with a beautiful woman, and no strings attached.</p> <p>He enters Cat Shoppe on the Sunset Strip looking for anyone, but when he sees the kitten-eared girl on the strip club's main stage, he knows he won't leave without <i>her.</i></p>"; 
